common-abilities-bow-barrage = Barragem
    .desc = Replace your broadhead arrow with a bandolier of smaller arrows to quickly barrage at your foes.
common-abilities-bow-barrage_shot = Barragem
    .desc = Quickly fire a number of smaller arrows to barrage your enemies with an unending stream of arrows.
common-abilities-bow-piercing_gale = Vendaval Perfurante
    .desc = Fire a spinning arrow capable of drilling through targets to reach beyond.
common-abilities-bow-fusillade = Fuzilaria
    .desc = Nock and draw 5 smaller arrows all at the same time, staggered so they release one slightly after the other.
common-abilities-bow-death_volley = Saraivada Mortal
    .desc = Fire a bundle of arrows into the air at a fixed angle that will split wide apart into a rain of death.
common-abilities-bow-thorn_stake = Estaca Espinhosa
    .desc = Fire a large spiky arrow into the ground. Any future targets that walk into the stake take damage from the thorns.
common-abilities-bow-burning_thorn_stake = Estaca Espinhosa Flamejante
    .desc = Fire a large spiky arrow into the ground. Any future targets that walk into the stake trigger a fiery explosion.
common-abilities-bow-freezing_thorn_stake = Estaca Espinhosa Congelante
    .desc = Fire a large spiky arrow into the ground. Any future targets that walk into the stake trigger an icy explosion.
common-abilities-bow-poison_thorn_stake = Estaca Espinhosa Venenosa
    .desc = Fire a large spiky arrow into the ground. Any future targets that walk into the stake trigger a poisonous explosion.
common-abilities-bow-lightning_thorn_stake = Estaca Espinhosa Relâmpago
    .desc = Fire a large spiky arrow into the ground. An arc of electricity strikes any future targets that walk near the stake.